    "abstract": "Parts list for the aft fuselage sill frames between stations C52 and C66, covering the frame ribs, the lower intercostals, the stiffeners and the fastener set that attaches them to the lower shell.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the detail parts of the aft fuselage sill frames between stations C52 and C66, including the loading rail reaction bracket land.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the left-hand side looking outboard and sheet 2 the right-hand side, which is symmetric except at the loading rail reaction bracket where the left-hand side carries an additional stiffener. Item numbers run forward to aft. The fastener quantities given are per frame bay, not per aircraft. The frame ribs are supplied as machined items and are not interchangeable between the two aircraft types because the frame pitch differs."
    },
